  23: kill tables and table 12); the flagship's first-hand re-ruling of 2026-09-25 (three earlier "fable5" rulings were
  24: opus-4-8 fallbacks), confirmed by GPT-6 Astra; table 13a; repair 15 (the TIME and REV decline carriers; table 14);
  25: its full-roster pass 2 (the HARD_RESET residue, table 15a); repair 16 (the CONTROL arm's residue-text count; table 16,
  26: 25/25 legs exact); and repair 16's F2 pass, which closed the chain with no row owed.  The committed text is r17:
  27: repair 16's code, identical by AST, with the ruling's corrections.  <OWED-BASE>
