FILE prep529.py
   1: #!/usr/bin/env python3
   2: """Assemble #529's COMMITTED versions into a staging mirror -- no write to the working tree.
   3: 
   4: usage: prep529.py <astra-verdict> <astra-ev> <opus-grade> <opus-ev>     (after the Astra run on the final text)
   5:        prep529.py --dry                                                (placeholders allowed; dummy entries)
   6: 
   7: Out: <records>/stage529/<repo path> for every file the commit writes, plus stage529/MANIFEST.txt.  Every input is
   8: checked: HEAD's subject starts #549 or #553; the round's scratchpad-built files are md5-pinned (PINNED); the files
   9: taken from the working tree are md5-pinned (WORKING) and, where the working file carries other units' lines, the
  10: staged version is BUILT from HEAD's (the checker, the precommit); the CHANGELOG block may carry no `<OWED`.
  11: """
  12: import hashlib, io, os, re, subprocess, sys
