 127:              "\t#  (#549, pinned UNQUOTED in gate_mips_folds.sh at 117 rows).\n"
 128:              "\t#  RAISED 31 -> 32 ON 2026-09-26, DELIBERATELY.  One newly gated probe: crime_width_probe.py\n"
 129:              "\t#  (#529, pinned UNQUOTED in gate_arm.sh at 226 rows; the working tree had carried its bump since\n"
