The main recounts agree: tables 13a, 14, 15a, and 16 contain 3, 18, 2, and 25 legs; the probe grows from 204 to 218 to 226 rows. I also verified all three fallback agent IDs and timestamps against the transcripts. I found that r17 implements the probe-text corrections, while correction 13’s required changes to the table and pass-2 records remain outstanding.
